VoiceBeat Metronome – Privacy Policy
Last updated: May 2026

VoiceBeat Metronome uses the device microphone solely for the purpose of processing voice commands such as starting or stopping the metronome or timer.

Information We Collect
The app does not collect, store, transmit, or share any personal data.
No audio recordings are saved or sent to any server.
All voice processing occurs entirely on your device.

Microphone Access
Microphone access is required only so the app can respond to spoken commands.
The microphone is never used for any other purpose.

Third‑Party Services
The app does not use analytics, advertising, tracking, or third‑party data collection tools.

Children’s Privacy
The app collects no data and is safe for all ages.

Contact
If you have questions, you can reach the developer via the email on the Play Store.
